            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zaimportuj <code>bill</code> z <code>mod.js</code>, aby kwota <code>bill</code> została wyświetlona w konsoli.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"mod.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bill = \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"export\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"default\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bill;\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"(node:7) Warning: To load an ES module, set &quot;type&quot;: &quot;module&quot; in the package.json or use the .mjs extension.\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"/home/default/code/file.js:3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"export default bill;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"^^^^^^\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"SyntaxError: Unexpected token 'export'\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    at wrapSafe (internal/modules/cjs/loader.js:915:16)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    at Module._compile (internal/modules/cjs/loader.js:963:27)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    at Object.Module._extensions..js (internal/modules/cjs/loader.js:1027:10)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    at Module.load (internal/modules/cjs/loader.js:863:32)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    at Function.Module._load (internal/modules/cjs/loader.js:708:14)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    at Function.executeUserEntryPoint [as runMain] (internal/modules/run_main.js:60:12)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    at internal/main/run_main_module.js:17:47\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import